│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ enhanced_expressive_capacity                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves excellent results with only 26 parameters and a tiny         │
│                          │ generalization gap (0.01). To improve further, I'll increase expressive capacity while    │
│                          │ maintaining parameter efficiency through shared parameterization.                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight is that the current collective parameter sharing acts as a strong         │
│                          │ regularizer. By adding a layer of parametrized controlled rotations (CRZ) with shared     │
│                          │ parameters applied strategically in the entangling region, we can:                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Increase expressivity to handle more complex feature interactions                      │
│                          │ 2. Maintain the regularization benefit of parameter sharing                               │
│                          │ 3. Keep the total parameter count reasonable (26 → ~32 parameters)                        │
│                          │ 4. Preserve the small generalization gap                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new block structure:                                                                  │
│                          │ - Collective RY input mixing                                                              │
│                          │ - Collective RZ phase adjustment                                                          │
│                          │ - New: CRZ parametrized entanglement with shared parameter (breaks the fixed CZ-only      │
│                          │ layer)                                                                                    │
│                          │ - Original CZ cube structure                                                              │
│                          │ - Second collective RZ layer (additional refinement)                                      │
│                          │ - Collective RY/RX output mixing                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This adds two new unique parameters per block (collective_crz, collective_rz_mid) while   │
│                          │ keeping most of the parameter sharing that prevents overfitting.                          │
